{"size":"1536x1024","n":1,"transparent_background":true,"is_style_transfer":false,"prompt":"Create ONE production-focused sprite sheet asset only: TAVI-010 — Idle Animation for the original 2D illustrated fantasy platformer Lanterns Underroot. Use the attached conversation's approved Tavi turnaround as the character-design reference: young teen adventurer, tousled bright blue hair, amber-brown eyes, long torn red scarf, cream rolled-sleeve tunic, layered brown leather harness and belt with small pouches, dark olive-gray trousers, brown bracers, wrapped sturdy brown boots, a short sword secured at the hip/back. Hand-painted illustrated 2D game sprite style with clean readable outline, consistent colors, modest painterly shading, crisp silhouette.

LAYOUT: exactly 6 full-body animation frames arranged in one horizontal row, equal-sized cells, same scale in every frame, same side-view orientation facing RIGHT, same ground baseline, evenly spaced, no overlap. Character height approximately 75% of each frame cell. Frame sequence shows a subtle idle loop only: 1) neutral standing pose, 2) slight inhale with shoulders rising a little, 3) gentle peak of breath with chest raised, 4) relax shoulders, 5) tiny blink and scarf tip settling, 6) returns exactly to the starting pose. Feet remain planted at the same coordinates throughout; no walking, no attacks, no jumping, no large body movement. Sword remains sheathed and does not change shape. Scarf has only tiny secondary motion. Keep silhouette and proportions identical across all six frames.

BACKGROUND: fully transparent alpha. No ground art, no shadows beyond a small attached foot-contact shadow if absolutely necessary, no environment, no props beyond Tavi's worn equipment, no panels, no grid, no frame borders, no numbers, no text, no labels, no watermark. Isolated characters only. Ensure the six frames are separated clearly and can be individually cropped into equal cells for a game engine sprite sheet."}

